WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,360
Can't avoid going short

2
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:15,550
Find me the keys

3
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,680
The key hasn't been found yet, Miss.

4
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,480
Wang Ping and Lu Meng are feeling a little unwell.

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,400
Went to the bathroom temporarily

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,240
They still have the key, and I'll give it to you when they come back.

7
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:30,040
You say they are not in a hurry, but you also try to find ways to say that they are in a hurry, and you never have a long memory.

8
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,120
At least you know how to take care of your comrades, Captain

9
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,080
Can you learn more?

10
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,160
At least look out for your companions

11
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,640
I am only responsible for the people I identify

12
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,800
You can't think of serious things in your mind

13
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,780
I have to owe this little sister so much for every word I say

14
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,940
Qin Ke, he is really loyal
